# --- Heavy binary source art ------------------------------------------------
# assets/city/textures/ is tracked on purpose: city_generator_large.usdc
# resolves its maps through the relative ./textures/ paths, so a clone
# without it renders untextured.
assets/city/*.blend
assets/city/*.blend1
assets/people/
assets/vehicles/generic_pack/
*.usdz
*.zip
*.tar.xz
*.fbx

